0020A0r 2               ; parse_with_field_load — current token is the field IDENT already matched by
0020A0r 2               ; with_lookup_field. Emits code for the field expression and leaves expr_type
0020A0r 2               ; set appropriately. Record-valued results stay as addresses on the stack.
0020A0r 2               parse_with_field_load:
0020A0r 2  20 rr rr             JSR     next_token              ; consume field name
0020A3r 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_with_field_base
0020A6r 2  AD rr rr             LDA     with_lookup_type
0020A9r 2  85 rr                STA     expr_type
